{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "4b0c2b87bb6bc64391fc0005a7e46ad0df30dbd612dc05519a8a20f782bfbbb1", "ja": "キャッ！？\n……{$P$}！？", "zh": "呀啊！？\n……{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "19cfca61b6878fa6bd3008de353fce4cb305661cb010997d943a3d50ffc52262", "ja": "い、いつからいたんですか？\nいるならいるって、声くらい掛けてください！", "zh": "你、你什么时候来的？\n你既然在，就说一声啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1035_p", "source_sha256": "08fa45ac00de1982dc67075036f999c896aa295bb9c69f8110d67d995ec94de7", "ja": "え……？　いや、最初からいたし、\nさっきも俺がレッスンを終わらせただろう？", "zh": "咦……？那个，我从一开始就在，\n刚刚也是我要大家结束练习的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "e4929ccdbd41e0232800cf2ffd5e0c7c9d5ce59691db5e53a61e5834ee8f021d", "ja": "あ。そ、そういえば……。コホン。", "zh": "啊，经、经你这么一说……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1037_p", "source_sha256": "bcd6987aaf90c2c0b9ada2dc837422f098eb0af8852148c3176c7eb434d61e15", "ja": "（そうか。俺に聞きたいことっていうのも口実で、\nただレッスンを続けたかっただけか……）", "zh": "（原来是这样，说有事要请教我也是借口，\n她只是想继续练习而已……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1038_p", "source_sha256": "119a72e7acf37475631ac092907b5f70f45032a5a86021f72f86ea89911e5c51", "ja": "どうしたんだ、静香。\n本番に向けて、何か心配事でもあるのか？", "zh": "静香，怎么了吗？\n关于正式演出，有什么地方让你担心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "ddeddfab3cc1dc4e4835c70deffbcd1924d87348a6736af7afdb00f083559494", "ja": "何かって……。もう、何を言ってるんですか？\nあるに決まってます。……全部です。", "zh": "什么地方……真是的，你在说什么？\n当然有啊……全部都很担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1040_p", "source_sha256": "a1f280298881d1b2da7431228c83a2df376e3218488ec6cad713a3fd9e162f8e", "ja": "全部？", "zh": "全部？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "928e1ccd0e09eef747337ebaec1672fd195432111c4b49f49128d4f40bdc1c1f", "ja": "全部は全部です。\n歌もダンスも、パフォーマンスも……心配です。", "zh": "对，就是全部。\n不管是唱歌、舞蹈，还是表演方式……都很担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1042_p", "source_sha256": "89c2821e103de7d158cb0c9cf87c841923726a5fb119b805279417be1a4ca7e8", "ja": "今の時点で必要なことはちゃんとできてるし、\nそんなに心配しなくてもいい気がするけど……。", "zh": "你目前都有把该做的事好好完成，\n我觉得你不需要担心那么多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "025c10e5ca0ef54fa283ed27e15ddddd93bc53eab5fa1486ff7d93a5d5b68047", "ja": "{$P$}の言うことだけじゃ、\n信用できません。", "zh": "只凭{$P$}说的话，\n我无法相信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1044_p", "source_sha256": "3d96234a28ece927eed8ca4cbdde20247ea88a73b0d92b912a2a9e369592e977", "ja": "そ、そうか……。それは残念だけど、\nそれじゃ、どうしたものかな。", "zh": "这、这样啊……那还真是遗憾，\n那该怎么办才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1045_se", "source_sha256": "8e7f14ac05b8af6347c8336517efb85357319e29b9542e34b554f154c45397ba", "ja": "コンコン", "zh": "叩叩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1046_002chi", "source_sha256": "090a784f3931d209898ba16184e878ee88d53f81a4388d05d0cb227a0748f35a", "ja": "失礼します。\n……すみません、使用中でしたか？", "zh": "打扰了。\n……不好意思，这里还在用吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1047_015siz", "source_sha256": "10cbf8b25cf07f65371ded5079d844b123a6ce4d452f1f29951af4cd62210a67", "ja": "えっ……ち、千早さん！？", "zh": "咦……千、千早！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1048_p", "source_sha256": "06fc4efca26bbaac6740b2f95340913eea505993bca872eb8756b286d47a56b7", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま、千早。\nもう仕事は終わったのか？", "zh": "嗯，辛苦了，千早。\n你的工作已经结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1049_002chi", "source_sha256": "f54438460b3c5abb1424f0d27276a639f1c11d28d75c7c3c25c505e350fafac2", "ja": "はい、{$P$}。\n予定より早く終わったので、自主練習をしようかと。", "zh": "是的，{$P$}。\n因为比预期来得早结束，就想说来自主练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1050_002chi", "source_sha256": "68357468ff0bb8b3ce7b00b3e3695681df8b2c9a7d09c48e554a91784113fdf1", "ja": "青羽さんに、レッスン室が空いていると\n聞いたのですが……先を越されてしまいましたね。", "zh": "我听青羽小姐说，\n这间练习室没有人用……看来你们捷足先登了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1051_015siz", "source_sha256": "024ae00ec50deef47b21eca992984ed31e7d6de6ca73a5bac8423b68a57ebf75", "ja": "！　す、すみません！\n今すぐ、片付けますっ！", "zh": "啊！对、对不起！\n我现在马上收拾东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1052_002chi", "source_sha256": "2202da31b625a46c34acb2a55c98d46e694e13294fe3af1da2c2c136c96da79d", "ja": "いいの、最上さん。\n空いていたら、使おうと思っただけだから。", "zh": "没关系的，最上。\n我只是想说如果没人用，那就来练习一下而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1053_p", "source_sha256": "a9949c428c624bb761dc0c36e8e46e8ca7d325a5e8b5509b1c59759de8984857", "ja": "そうだ。静香、歌に不安があるって言ってたよな。\nなら、千早に聞いてもらわないか？", "zh": "对了，静香，你刚刚不是说很担心歌的部分？\n既然这样，要不要让千早帮你听听看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1054_015siz", "source_sha256": "e37e50ec2500064f46e9287901e763248c4947f9a0d94282ae4fc323a493f208", "ja": "ええっ！？\nそ、そんな！　千早さんになんて、私……。", "zh": "咦咦！？\n这、这怎么好意思！还要麻烦千早，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1055_p", "source_sha256": "f39853e1c2648bdb0500b61b6ed2daf9ade519a55f9a8c8156a81de4134da847", "ja": "千早は、事務所の先輩じゃないか。\nレッスンを見てもらうのはいいことだと思うけど。", "zh": "千早是事务所的前辈啊。\n请她帮忙看一下练习状况，应该会对你很有帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1056_p", "source_sha256": "54de47248950d6b0ec382f3bf6db8d43b08553c7f876fecee839640ddf8c8613", "ja": "千早、どうだ？\n静香のレッスンを見てやってくれないか？", "zh": "千早，你觉得呢？\n可以帮忙看一下静香练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1057_002chi", "source_sha256": "6e6150542c3c6047daa87b2c69481a0093543a045ce6c3a67eeae4103a88a26f", "ja": "わかりました。人のレッスンを見ることが、\n自分自身の勉強にも繋がると思いますから。", "zh": "我明白了，看别人练习，\n自己也能有所收获。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1058_002chi", "source_sha256": "c503372f5693586fec2e5c06b3704205cd1024418591e7cc35347166294d4f0b", "ja": "最上さん。\nご迷惑でなければ、聞かせてもらえるかしら。", "zh": "最上。\n如果不麻烦的话，可以让我听听看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1059_015siz", "source_sha256": "70bb15cf20e22595192d62692b2e8e0ec52c86e241ab74b39629b1be6a83b28c", "ja": "そんな、迷惑だなんて……！\nあの、私のほうこそ、よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "怎么会麻烦……！\n那个，是我才要请你多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1060_002chi", "source_sha256": "41e7c167192dc209b9aeb655b74f8990ffc2269919e35461b67cd28ece6119ee", "ja": "ありがとう。\n……それじゃ、始めましょうか。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n……那我们就开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1061_015siz", "source_sha256": "c8fbffdc5bea3b6a1a8880c2ac2a34b75cb8d858807d837e86c152c6fea63a29", "ja": "は、はい！", "zh": "好、好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1062_null", "source_sha256": "f57cfdaa3423982ac99cb2c739d50536ade8181714dd218d7b7e16d5029bb1e3", "ja": "10分後……", "zh": "10分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1063_015siz", "source_sha256": "64899541f734206cdc493ed67e313eef16d63893b2351331e83d290927654074", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……", "zh": "呼、呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1064_002chi", "source_sha256": "50081f2991d3a8e340ddf0ab59c77a81c7b7900c37cfc03f9a33f7ed31e34f74", "ja": "お疲れさま、最上さん。\nとても良かったと思うわ。", "zh": "辛苦你了，最上。\n我觉得你唱得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1065_015siz", "source_sha256": "e03570284767d5afae064bc7f1e5a333e354d885722e679968859246e83a244e", "ja": "！\nほ、本当ですか……！", "zh": "！\n真、真的吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1066_002chi", "source_sha256": "a76a51081b55c4804e5cae68d242a0c94545b6cc715f169f374232881f3652d4", "ja": "ええ、けど……そうね。あえて言うなら、\n少しだけ歌が走ってしまっていたみたい。", "zh": "真的，不过……对了。一定要说的话，\n感觉你唱得稍微有点快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1067_002chi", "source_sha256": "775b7ce1c9ad7df8e57c5bdb0a01950e2a1649b463a96fafcb2cb642885685d1", "ja": "最上さんの曲は、確かに少しテンポは速いけれど。\n引っ張られてしまわないように、気をつけて。", "zh": "最上唱的这首歌，节奏确实比较快一些，\n要小心别被影响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1068_015siz", "source_sha256": "74f5c3c7c10c57771fd2a8a435be5b388e6ddd6693feb8a793fdd47bb012db32", "ja": "は、はいっ！", "zh": "好、好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1069_002chi", "source_sha256": "5f7494a86fdf66a1e8701c1fbba887758aaefe2e07044132c0ba6ba769e6bc1e", "ja": "それから……声も、少し硬い印象で……。\nきっと、体が硬くなっていたのね。", "zh": "然后就是……声音给人的感觉也有点僵硬……\n应该是因为身体也变僵硬了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1070_002chi", "source_sha256": "f5cb3ffccc1c6c6e8c57cc2ee549da0ae43ee51243992e08e623189215395c77", "ja": "この曲は、前半の伸びやかさが、大きな魅力でもあると\n思うの。だから……あまり緊張しないで。", "zh": "这首歌前半段那种悠扬的感觉，\n也是它吸引人的地方之一，所以……不要太紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1071_015siz", "source_sha256": "39aa9d85ea23a59a60eabd5c4ab1d597a7eea516577da7278f1a1f486539f395", "ja": "はいっ……ありがとうございます！", "zh": "好的……谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1072_002chi", "source_sha256": "1664197479c4a0270dd3ba7ce417309af365906e837937f578573e17e1721255", "ja": "どういたしまして。\n最上さんの想い、ファンの皆さんに届くといいわね。", "zh": "不客气。\n希望最上的心意，能够传达给粉丝们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1073_015siz", "source_sha256": "084fd96b3eed28997af44a36204d6b240323812ec373bc171f6f4d3707cc8906", "ja": "千早さん……。", "zh": "千早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1074_015siz", "source_sha256": "8e929d3ecc806246be731796bf8ae11ad31584a63c0dcc474cfb1edd2f272512", "ja": "私……私、必ず届けてみせます！\n私の想いを……歌を、ファンの人達に！", "zh": "我……我一定会传递出去的！\n把我的心意……用歌声传递给粉丝们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1075_002chi", "source_sha256": "92ab27be89c9e2c65ff7d17a2961744ed8c8ba041127c6180ef7aa217d3340d4", "ja": "ええ。その時を、私も楽しみにしているわ。", "zh": "是啊，我也很期待你那天的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1076_015siz", "source_sha256": "0c9ad4f638d72e44515f0650ac6a6c6dfbc2b6c0fb1adb3e627ef7b75afd6d93", "ja": "ありがとうございました。\n失礼します。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n那我先回去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1077_se", "source_sha256": "ec1af790cbe5a717d390a701e0d39fdb8669efd3b376f0195d6a366da2749d27", "ja": "パタン……", "zh": "磅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1078_015siz", "source_sha256": "ca66890221f2baed11abe84b29d9fb7ef95a6b8fec36d2d6d86b684f2d3a5af2", "ja": "…………はぁ。", "zh": "…………呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1079_p", "source_sha256": "74e708e15836429860f2ab1c72afec5f4bfbc2ead931d6db57835a10f8a27c14", "ja": "お疲れさま、静香。\nよかったな、千早に褒められたじゃないか。", "zh": "辛苦你了，静香。\n太好了呢，千早这么夸奖你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1081_p", "source_sha256": "a3fa4f66e4ebb2759b34297f1c356b02e897c3eaff9a8b20f5f720620affcc34", "ja": "？\nなんだ、どうして怒ってるんだ？", "zh": "？\n什么事？你为什么生气？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1082_015siz", "source_sha256": "fec8e37f49aa028c58eaa137788eee61cb9c1a35eab7601e602d3dec2afa6715", "ja": "「どうして怒ってるんだ」、じゃありません！\n突然、千早さんの前で歌わせるなんて……！", "zh": "你还问我「为什么生气」！\n竟突然叫我在千早面前唱歌……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1083_p", "source_sha256": "46e1daec72e58a345a206883e7f67c3d0cf1f597e2de1c8f3363874d056bf157", "ja": "そう言われても、練習になると思ったし……\n千早も是非って言ってたんだし、いいじゃないか。", "zh": "就算你这么说，我觉得那是很好的练习啊……\n千早也说务必让她听听看，应该没关系吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1084_015siz", "source_sha256": "9ae635e46a8ef1fcf50b538631d98dd31dbc7878eb16f7bb88d4a54ee2d64d92", "ja": "そういう問題じゃありません！　よりにもよって、\n千早さんみたいなすごい先輩の前で……。", "zh": "不是这个问题！你谁不选，\n偏偏要我在千早那么厉害的前辈面前唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1085_p", "source_sha256": "45713c0555c05aa32859989e7fad334e6014b287c443d5f39b82c00530d91399", "ja": "でもセンターになったら、\n千早より前で歌うことになるんだぞ？", "zh": "可是如果成为Center，\n也会在千早的面前唱歌喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1086_015siz", "source_sha256": "1cce887096770731984fae3d1d18cf45e8625e8ecdfd2540d85234ccf9996087", "ja": "そ、それは……\nそう、ですけど……。", "zh": "那、那个……\n是这样没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1087_015siz", "source_sha256": "b4d33cf2d3b17dbb3617c05fd964c8f2e4ea67ef70744d1e20918501bdedcc1b", "ja": "……む～……。", "zh": "……唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1088_p", "source_sha256": "576695cd9aae517afc7cd5edc2a67005558d63f6fffa2a24b54154f05cb6adc7", "ja": "センターなら、先輩を超えるつもりで、\n頑張らなくちゃな？", "zh": "既然身为Center，就要抱持着超越前辈的觉悟，\n好好努力才对喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1089_015siz", "source_sha256": "ec94fb32594698ad8a0ad8237c1cfb68b7ff94d964f8ba4c995abab6f6299310", "ja": "わ、わかってます！\nだからって、あんな急に…緊張するじゃないですか！", "zh": "我、我知道啦！\n就算是这样，那么突然……任谁都会很紧张吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1090_p", "source_sha256": "b7ebf71c958dc0ed6b48019d59bb544105fe42d85c2d15a5c8c42bc48a379bdd", "ja": "なんだ、それで怒ってたのか。\nお客さんの前で歌うより緊張したとか？", "zh": "什么啊，你在气这个啊。\n比在客人面前唱歌还紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1091_015siz", "source_sha256": "ea3397f13a4f81585b08e06105805c00a037677f6b9c4babacc28d171450c734", "ja": "も、もう……！\n{$P$}なんか、知りません！", "zh": "真、真是的……！\n我不想理{$P$}了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_002_1092_015siz", "source_sha256": "1a065367094497a85b689739fd7b5eb83fa6bff08fa83b406d511371fc857041", "ja": "私、本番では緊張なんかしませんから！\n絶対にしませんからねっ！", "zh": "我正式上场时才不会紧张！\n绝对不会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
